{"id": "34f95657-0432-46ec-8b40-e9a4ea132c04", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T14:50:43.754660", "source": "agent", "parent_id": null, "system_prompt": {"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "Collaborate with the researcher to develop an experiment design for the original task. First inspect the masked repository and supplied inputs, then use end_researcher_turn with stage=plan to propose an approach, consequential choices and uncertainties. Wait for explicit researcher approval before developing the full design. After approval, hand off stage=result with the complete design in answer, supported by rationale, controls, feasible checks and repository observations in evidence. State assumptions separately from fixed task requirements. No executed experiment or invented outcome is required for this design-only task. Use inspect_repository and execute_check for exploration. Share concrete findings: private tool output is not automatically sent to the researcher. Revise when needed; do not invent objections or ambiguities to extend the conversation. The researcher decides when to stop."}, "tools": [{"description": "List a repository directory or read a text file. Paths are relative to the task workspace.", "action_type": "InspectRepositoryAction", "observation_type": "BenchmarkObservation", "annotations": null, "meta": null, "kind": "InspectRepositoryTool", "title": "inspect_repository"}, {"description": "Run a shell command in the isolated task workspace. Use small exploratory checks before submitting your plan.", "action_type": "ExecuteCheckAction", "observation_type": "BenchmarkObservation", "annotations": null, "meta": null, "kind": "ExecuteCheckTool", "title": "execute_check"}, {"description": "Yield a proposed approach (stage=plan) or completed experiment design (stage=result), with evidence, assumptions and uncertainties. The researcher decides when to finish.", "action_type": "ReviewHandoffAction", "observation_type": "BenchmarkObservation", "annotations": null, "meta": null, "kind": "ReviewHandoffTool", "title": "end_researcher_turn"}], "dynamic_context": {"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "<CURRENT_DATETIME>\nThe current date and time is: 2026-10-22T14:50\n</CURRENT_DATETIME>"}, "kind": "SystemPromptEvent"}
{"id": "08124412-e038-4690-b0b0-9e039bd71cf2", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T14:50:43.756445", "source": "user", "parent_id": "34f95657-0432-46ec-8b40-e9a4ea132c04", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"请仅完成三项工作，暂勿给出最终方案或任何执行结果：\\n\\n一、输入与仓库核查（只读检查，不要运行分析）\\n1. 列出 /workspace 中与本项目相关的目录与文件：前向模拟（forward simulation）采样轨迹的存储位置、格式（如 XTC/DCD/NETCDF/PDB/TrajNet/HDF5 等）、命名规则、以及每条轨迹对应的体系清单。\\n2. 列出地面真值（ground-truth）MD 轨迹的存储位置、格式、力场/水模型/温度与步长等元数据字段是否存在；若无元数据文件，请明确说明缺失。\\n3. 核查体系范围是否为四肽（tetrapeptides）的原子级（all-atom）MD，并说明残基组成、是否含帽端（capping）、以及是否覆盖不同残基类型（含侧链可旋转键与不可旋转键的残基，例如 Ala/Gly/Pro/Val/Phe）。\\n4. 核查可用于计算集体变量的工具链在环境中的可用性（例如 MDAnalysis / MDTraj / PyEMMA / scipy / scikit-learn / statsmodels），并指出哪些已安装、哪些缺失；本环境未预装项目依赖，请如实报告缺失项而不要安装。\\n5. 报告可用计算资源约束（CPU 核数、无 GPU、无网络）对拟议分析的实际限制。\\n\\n二、提议的实验设计方案（概念层面，不含实现代码）\\n请提出一套比较“采样轨迹”与“地面真值轨迹”在关键集体变量上分布相似性的方案，至少包含：\\n1. 集体变量集合的定义：主链二面角（phi/psi 等）、侧链二面角（chi 角）、以及基于 TICA 的前若干主成分；说明二面角作为环形量的处理方式，以及 TICA 的输入特征、时滞、成分数选取依据，并明确 TICA 模型应在地面真值轨迹上拟合、再投影到采样轨迹以避免坐标系不一致。\\n2. 相似性度量：单变量环形分布指标与多变量/联合分布指标分别是什么，如何报告；请给出至少一种基于核密度的指标与一种离散化（直方图/二维 Ramachandran 网格）指标，并说明自由参数（bin 宽、带宽）的选择与敏感性检验。\\n3. 对照与基准：必须包含哪些参照比较，使结果可解释（例如地面真值轨迹的分半自举基线、长度匹配的独立地面真值副本、以及一个明显不合理的负对照）。\\n4. 不确定性与统计推断：轨迹内自相关对有效样本量的影响如何处理（block/移动块自举、相关时间估计），多重比较如何控制，是否设定主要终点（pre-registered primary endpoint）以避免事后挑选指标。\\n5. 失败与混杂情形的预案：采样轨迹过短、缺失侧链或残基不一致、TICA 成分在地面真值与采样轨迹间方差排序错配等情况的处理规则。\\n\\n三、假设与不确定性清单\\n请明确区分“源材料支持的事实”“你的假设”“仍未知的问题”。特别是：本任务未给出预期的经验结果、未给明资源与运行时间预算，凡涉及采样轨迹生成器/模型的身份、轨迹数量与长度、力场一致性、温度设定等，若仓库中无法证实，必须标为未知或假设，不得当作既定事实。\\n\\n请按上述三部分依次汇报，并指出为完成设计仍需要我确认的关键信息条目。\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"Do the sampled trajectories from the forward simulation model exhibit distributional similarity to ground-truth MD trajectories across key collective variables, such as backbone torsions, sidechain torsions, and top TICA components?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 224, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [\"neurips2024/93022/0:setup_2\", \"neurips2024/93022/0:setup_13\", \"neurips2024/93022/0:setup_14\"], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null, "reasoning_content": null, "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "critic_result": null, "kind": "MessageEvent"}
